ectly only when you need lower-level access — raw ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCredential"},{"text":" \/","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"getAssertion"},{"text":", credential management, or bio enrollment.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is an actor; a client’s lifetime is bound to the underlying "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The constructor takes four parameters that shape every ceremony:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"text":" — the secure origin the client is bound to. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" enforces","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the W3C secure-context rule; the client refuses to sign for relying parties whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"identifier doesn’t match."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPublicSuffix"},{"type":"text","text":" — a closure into a Public Suffix List, used to validate that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the relying-party identifier is a registrable suffix of the origin’s effective"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"domain."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enterpriseRpIds"},{"type":"text","text":" — relying-party identifiers allowed to receive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform-managed enterprise attestation. When the request specifies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/